{
  "name": "dsh-image-gen",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "DSH 生图插件：让 AI 在对话里直接调生图接口出图（文生图 + 参考图改图，参考图可直接引用对话里最近的图 @last，改图自动沿用参考图比例）。工具查询与配置分离（image_config / image_admin）；支持多接入点、异步任务轮询、请求体模板与结果取值路径；图片落盘并附提示词元数据、回传对话，侧边栏「生图」面板管理接入点/模型与历史画廊，支持拖拽上传参考图。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/plugin.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/plugin.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "locale",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "image",
    "image-generation",
    "text-to-image",
    "image-edit"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "hjf2687",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/hjf2687/dsh-image-gen.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/hjf2687/dsh-image-gen/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/hjf2687/dsh-image-gen#readme",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node --check lib/plugin.js && node --check lib/host.js && node --check lib/runner.js && node --check lib/store.js && node --check lib/protocol.js && node --check lib/client.js"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ]
    }
  }
}
